config BR2_PACKAGE_AIC8800_DRIVER
	bool "aic8800-driver (AIC8800 WiFi+BT kernel modules)"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  Out-of-tree kernel driver for AIC8800 series WiFi+BT chipsets,
	  used by the Creality Hi mainboard. Source pulled from vendor BSP.

	  Builds four kernel modules:
	    - aic_bsp     (board support / power sequencing)
	    - aic8800_fdrv (WiFi function driver — cfg80211-based)
	    - aic8800_btlpm (Bluetooth low-power management)
	    - aic8800_btusb (Bluetooth USB transport)

	  Pairs with BR2_PACKAGE_AIC8800_FIRMWARE for the firmware blobs.

comment "aic8800-driver requires a Linux kernel to be built"
	depends on !BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
